SEL: new opt-in ``fast`` value for ``sel.pull_methods`` that collects data with the read-only SEL Fast protocols on a binary Telnet session (or on the serial port for serial pulls): the relay definition, Fast Meter channels and one sample, the Fast Operate configuration (only read), and on relays that support Fast Message reads (e.g. SEL-400 series), the FID, BFID, serial and part numbers, relay and station IDs, active group, self-test status, and the last events. Relay settings aren't available with these protocols. The codec and the ``SELFast`` class are in the new ``peat.modules.sel.sel_fast``, and only an allowlist of read-only requests can be built or written to a SEL ASCII session.
